  "title": "[New extensions] Specifying Zvbc32e and Zvkgs (vector carryless SEW <= 32, vector-scalar GHASH) ",
  "user": {
    "login": "nibrunieAtSi5",
    "id": 82109999,
    "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgyMTA5OTk5",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82109999?v=4",
